---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 274;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08fxband">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="USD/VND trading band widened from plus or minus 3 percent to plus or minus 5 percent of the central rate of 23,637, so the ceiling moved from 24,346 to 24,819; Vietcombank quoted 24,495.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>The band that widened on 17 October 2022 (VND per USD)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Biên độ được nới ngày 17/10/2022 (đồng mỗi USD)</tspan></text>
<rect x="106.5" y="74" width="709.2" height="12" rx="4" class="barg" />
      <text x="471.1" y="102" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>New band ±5% (from 17 Oct 2022): 22,455 to 24,819</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Biên độ mới ±5% (từ 17/10/2022): 22.455 đến 24.819</tspan></text>
      <rect x="248.4" y="116" width="425.4" height="12" rx="4" class="barm" />
      <text x="471.1" y="144" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Old band ±3%: 22,928 to 24,346</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Biên độ cũ ±3%: 22.928 đến 24.346</tspan></text>
      <line x1="60" y1="170" x2="840" y2="170" class="ln" />
      <line x1="120.0" y1="166" x2="120.0" y2="176" class="ln" />
      <text x="120.0" y="194" class="m" text-anchor="middle">22,500</text>
      <line x1="270.0" y1="166" x2="270.0" y2="176" class="ln" />
      <text x="270.0" y="194" class="m" text-anchor="middle">23,000</text>
      <line x1="420.0" y1="166" x2="420.0" y2="176" class="ln" />
      <text x="420.0" y="194" class="m" text-anchor="middle">23,500</text>
      <line x1="570.0" y1="166" x2="570.0" y2="176" class="ln" />
      <text x="570.0" y="194" class="m" text-anchor="middle">24,000</text>
      <line x1="720.0" y1="166" x2="720.0" y2="176" class="ln" />
      <text x="720.0" y="194" class="m" text-anchor="middle">24,500</text>
      <line x1="461.1" y1="60" x2="461.1" y2="170" class="lng" />
      <text x="461.1" y="52" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Central rate 23,637 (18 Oct 2022)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ giá trung tâm 23.637 (18/10/2022)</tspan></text>
      <line x1="718.5" y1="202" x2="718.5" y2="218" class="lnr" />
      <text x="718.5" y="236" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Vietcombank dollar rate 24,495</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ giá bán USD Vietcombank 24.495</tspan></text>
      <text x="718.5" y="254" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>above the old ceiling of 24,346</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vượt trần cũ 24.346</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Band edges are computed as 23,637 × 0.97, × 1.03, × 0.95 and × 1.05. Central rate and Vietcombank quote: The Investor, 18 October 2022. The widening was Decision 1747 (Vietstock, VietnamPlus).</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Biên độ tính bằng 23.637 × 0,97; × 1,03; × 0,95; × 1,05. Tỷ giá trung tâm và giá Vietcombank: The Investor, 18/10/2022. Việc nới biên độ là Quyết định 1747 (Vietstock, VietnamPlus).</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08fxband figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
